    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Catfall</strong>, you are the most precious member of a spaceship crew \u2014 a cat whose warmth and gentle purrs bring comfort to everyone on board. Life is perfect\u2026 until a sudden disaster throws everything into chaos. And who knows \u2014 maybe now the fate of the entire crew will be up to one small, fluffy hero\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s all in your paws! Embark on a short <i>sci-fi cat adventure</i> and save the ship\u2026 or at least try not to make things worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/ab8f6f0d9ec2698e46815e97d8350ef7.poster.avif?t=1755189902\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/ab8f6f0d9ec2698e46815e97d8350ef7.webm?t=1755189902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/ab8f6f0d9ec2698e46815e97d8350ef7.mp4?t=1755189902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE SPACESHIP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire starship is at your service now, and you are the master here! Sneak into hidden corners, uncover the crew\u2019s secrets and go everywhere you can stick your little nose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BE A CAT AND HAVE FUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget to be your adorable feline self \u2014 hunt for snacks, claim the coziest nap spots, and keep your spirits high. After all, your well-being might just be the key to surviving this journey. And remember: naughtiness is always an option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/1461030d9cfa3d3d3f0aa1b4a1427c88.poster.avif?t=1755189902\" width=616 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/1461030d9cfa3d3d3f0aa1b4a1427c88.webm?t=1755189902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/1461030d9cfa3d3d3f0aa1b4a1427c88.mp4?t=1755189902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLVE PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a cat, you\u2019re surprisingly good at solving various puzzles. Push a button here, drag a cable there, and suddenly \u2014 the power\u2019s back on! Maybe it\u2019s just feline curiosity at work, but  does it matter if it works.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR CAT </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you can choose which one you want to play: an orange troublemaker, a calm grey homebody, a white handsome dust collector, or this black ball of fur with green eyes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/b09e667cf883a6bec511d41b6bec641c.poster.avif?t=1755189902\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/b09e667cf883a6bec511d41b6bec641c.webm?t=1755189902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/b09e667cf883a6bec511d41b6bec641c.mp4?t=1755189902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Catfall</strong>, you are the most precious member of a spaceship crew \u2014 a cat whose warmth and gentle purrs bring comfort to everyone on board. Life is perfect\u2026 until a sudden disaster throws everything into chaos. And who knows \u2014 maybe now the fate of the entire crew will be up to one small, fluffy hero\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s all in your paws! Embark on a short <i>sci-fi cat adventure</i> and save the ship\u2026 or at least try not to make things worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/ab8f6f0d9ec2698e46815e97d8350ef7.poster.avif?t=1755189902\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/ab8f6f0d9ec2698e46815e97d8350ef7.webm?t=1755189902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/ab8f6f0d9ec2698e46815e97d8350ef7.mp4?t=1755189902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE SPACESHIP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire starship is at your service now, and you are the master here! Sneak into hidden corners, uncover the crew\u2019s secrets and go everywhere you can stick your little nose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BE A CAT AND HAVE FUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget to be your adorable feline self \u2014 hunt for snacks, claim the coziest nap spots, and keep your spirits high. After all, your well-being might just be the key to surviving this journey. And remember: naughtiness is always an option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/1461030d9cfa3d3d3f0aa1b4a1427c88.poster.avif?t=1755189902\" width=616 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/1461030d9cfa3d3d3f0aa1b4a1427c88.webm?t=1755189902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/1461030d9cfa3d3d3f0aa1b4a1427c88.mp4?t=1755189902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLVE PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a cat, you\u2019re surprisingly good at solving various puzzles. Push a button here, drag a cable there, and suddenly \u2014 the power\u2019s back on! Maybe it\u2019s just feline curiosity at work, but  does it matter if it works.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR CAT </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you can choose which one you want to play: an orange troublemaker, a calm grey homebody, a white handsome dust collector, or this black ball of fur with green eyes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/b09e667cf883a6bec511d41b6bec641c.poster.avif?t=1755189902\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/b09e667cf883a6bec511d41b6bec641c.webm?t=1755189902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/b09e667cf883a6bec511d41b6bec641c.mp4?t=1755189902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Taking a cat on a spaceship? Great idea, as long as everything goes according to plan. It's a short road from fun adventures to sudden problems. And who knows? Maybe now the fate of the entire crew depends on one little fluffy hero... After all, cats always land on their paws, don\u2019t they?",
